les are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a4f4ac0bac8eff48a8\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"FRESH MEAT\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a4d7692d104ae98644c1bbc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 4\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":40,\"color\":\"#c8cdd0\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"6b3f0bd6-f219-b12b-c112-ce0741445a23\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f677\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f678\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f679\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f67a\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T12:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T14:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":40,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a4f4ac0bac8eff48ab\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":23,\"quantity_sold\":14,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5f9cc9f60b4b6abcd03bd7\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":10,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e052\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"FRESH MEAT\",\"sort_key\":\"FRESH MEAT\",\"description\":\"<p>A group of Internet influencers venture into an abandoned prison to create content unaware that one deranged inmate never left. Inadvertently unleashing the ravenous sole survivor they're now trapped, fighting for survival while trying to capture every terrifying moment in the hope it all goes viral. A wild, blood-soaked survival horror that throws a group of strangers into a deadly situation. Packed with inventive splatter kills, over-the-top practical effects, and non-stop tension, it’s designed to shock, scare, and entertain from start to finish. A film for horror fans who love to scream, laugh, and cheer.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577489604temp-1784577489549-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\",\"runtime\":\"100\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"Canada\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Daniel Turres\",\"cast\":\"Joelle Farrow, Hannah Galway, Mika Amonson, Tyson Wong\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.514Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:44:12.264Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:51:14.579Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71646d929fd78f8b27f\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE DEATH OF US\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d8f172ba3569f93d018c\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 1\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":166,\"color\":\"#99c6ef\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"18b3da24-c60c-ecd9-f718-b6803037dd63\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d49458\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d49459\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d4945a\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d4945b\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T12:05:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T14:05:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":166,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea71646d929fd78f8b282\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":119,\"quantity_sold\":91,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":28,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"4\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fba16e066d6c84863df56\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":39,\"quantity_sold\":39,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e0b9\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"THE DEATH OF US\",\"sort_key\":\"DEATH OF US, THE\",\"description\":\"<p>Explore the complexity of grief through a loving couple in a healthy relationship shattered by the loss of their child during a violent home invasion at the hands of a cult. As they struggle to come to terms with their loss, and its devastating impact,  Casey, haunted by visions of a supernatural entity connected to their tragedy, and her partner Danny become entangled in the actions of the cult responsible for their devastating nightmare. Can their bond endure such unimaginable trauma? Or will their overwhelming agonised sorrow and otherworldly forces  destroy them completely?</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579816925temp-1784579816841-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"88\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"World\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Annabella Richinda Rich\",\"cast\":\"Nicholas Vince, Marta Svetek, Annabella Rich, Chris Mills\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e02c\",\"name\":\"First Blood\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.654Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:36:54.809Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:43:15.551Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea89ff4ac0bac8eff485a\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE FRIGHT STUFF\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 3\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d19a120a5c364136d42b\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 3\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 3\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":41,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"faf60e2b-1976-4811-97c8-389557fc83d2\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b481\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Passholder Tickets\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b482\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Single Tickets\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b483\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b484\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T12:15:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T13:46:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":41,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea89ff4ac0bac8eff485d\",\"name\":\"Single Tickets\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":24,\"quantity_sold\":12,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":12,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5f9121a84b747faaee6a53\",\"name\":\"Passholder Tickets\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":10,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e0bd\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"THE FRIGHT STUFF\",\"sort_key\":\"FRIGHT STUFF, THE\",\"description\":\"<p>An all-access documentary that takes the viewer behind the scenes of the haunted house industry in America. A fascinating exploration into the beginnings of haunted houses and the 365-day pursuit to give people the fright of their lives, every aspect of the business is detailed from its amazing origins to where the culture is now. Producer and main interviewee John Laflamboy ran the Statesville Haunting Prison in Joliet, Illinois, and his reminiscences of his ups and downs will amaze non-Americans especially with regard to the haunted house construct that sunk in a storm!</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784973556264temp-1784973556178-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\",\"runtime\":\"71\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Mike Meyer\",\"cast\":\"John Laflamboy\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e05c\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.660Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:36:37.963Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:59:44.595Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71d46d929fd78f8b2f7\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"RECLUSE\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53dc50f89ce2f3d85a453d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 2\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":74,\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"e2b15fdc-5d76-c3e8-6bee-9835d6ec4e83\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1d\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1e\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1f\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d20\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T12:15:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T14:17:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":72,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea71d46d929fd78f8b2fa\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":46,\"quantity_sold\":46,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5faff6a43dee43960729c4\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":18,\"quantity_sold\":18,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"4\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e08e\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"RECLUSE\",\"sort_key\":\"RECLUSE\",\"description\":\"<p>Working as a movie audio engineer for movies, Joan is obsessed with sounds. This  fascination becomes vital when she is summoned to her family’s New England mansion to tend to her severely burned and bedridden father. While reconnecting with her dad’s hired help, Joan can’t shake the ghosts of her past, largely tied to her mother’s long-unsolved disappearance. But something else isn’t right. Initially just figurative, those ghosts may in fact be literal and are possibly connected to her father’s dabbling in the occult. As Joan is about to find out, the truth is much scarier than she could’ve imagined.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579272352temp-1784579272155-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"102\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Henry Chaisson\",\"cast\":\"Sasha Frolova, Xander Berkeley, Toby Poser, Mia Vallet\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.589Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:40:01.391Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T12:11:18.996Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea89ef4ac0bac8eff484e\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"SYNTHESIZED\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 3\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d19a120a5c364136d42b\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 3\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 3\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":41,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"faf60e2b-1976-4811-97c8-389557fc83d2\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"