 of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a8de76c87648bb92a165c02\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"HERALDRY PARANORMAL\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53dc50f89ce2f3d85a453d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 2\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":74,\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"e2b15fdc-5d76-c3e8-6bee-9835d6ec4e83\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1d\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1e\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1f\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d20\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T21:55:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T23:39:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\"