vestigation horror, this comedy shocker blends the found-footage styles of REC and GRAVE ENCOUNTERS with modern social media and Vlog-style content. A boisterous, fast-paced, enjoyable ride that has had heaps of passion poured into it, with lovable individuals you instantly engage with, it also stands as a vital representation for queer voices, featuring many characters from LGBTQ+ backgrounds.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577889481temp-1784577889421-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"93\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"World\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Ashley Nashville\",\"cast\":\"Jimmy Roberts, Parker Paige, Tara Buranakul, Lance J. Parker\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e02c\",\"name\":\"First Blood\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.544Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:42:44.886Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T11:08:48.926Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on 