858c3034cfd46f50cd2c00\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e040\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"CRAZY LIPS\",\"sort_key\":\"CRAZY LIPS\",\"description\":\"<p>Omega Project, the Japanese company behind ICHI THE KILLER and AUDITION, also made two cult movies produced by Takashige Ichise (the JUON/DARK WATER franchises), written by Hiroshi Takahashi (the RING series), and now remastered from original negatives by director Hiroshi Takahashi. After her brother is accused of murdering four people, his sister, desperate to prove his innocence, goes to a psychic for help in CRAZY LIPS. The price asked is far more than she expected, and the answers are nothing she could ever have imagined. And what is the FBI doing investigating a murder in Japan?</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577216112temp-1784577216034-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2000\",\"runtime\":\"83\",\"language\":\"Japanese\",\"country\":\"Japan\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"genre\":\"Japanese\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Hirohisa Sasaki\",\"cast\":\"Hitomi Miwa, Kazuma Suzuki, Ren Ôsugi, Hiroshi Abe\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.491Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:45:29.337Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:53:25.490Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":f