Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":39,\"quantity_sold\":39,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c3034cfd46f50cd2c00\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e09c\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"SHORT FILM SHOWCASE 3\",\"sort_key\":\"SHORT FILM SHOWCASE 3\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Grýlu Sker: An Icelandic Ghost Story (London Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Kevin McTurk.&nbsp;With: Peter Stormare, Piotr Michael.&nbsp;&nbsp; ICELAND 2026.&nbsp;22min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shipwrecked off the coast of Iceland, an explorer must fight for survival on a desolate island inhabited by the bloodthirsty witch Grýla.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Candle (European Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Ren Ariel Sano.&nbsp;With: Daisy Lopez, John-Michael Sedor.&nbsp;USA 2026.&nbsp;9min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Have your cake...and it eats you.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Vape Glow (World Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Steven Schloss.&nbsp;With: Samuel Dunning, Kelsey Lea Jones.&nbsp;USA 2026.&nbsp;6min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Told entirely from the perspective of a recalled vape pen, Mike puffs around a dark vacation rental, illuminating it during an unusual blackout.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>STROBE WARNING</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Inheritor (World Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Ryan Lilienfield.&nbsp; With: Nastasia Koulic, Piper Verbick, Alyassa Renne Olson.&nbsp; USA 2026.&nbsp;14min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>On the day of her ascension within her secluded, tree-worshipping cult, Ama, a sheltered young woman leaps into a treacherous psychedelic ritual that forces her to choose between her duty to her people and her desire to be with her childhood best friend and lover, Oakley&nbsp;</p><p><strong>STROBE WARNING</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The Chosen (UK Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Brady Richards.&nbsp; With: Toby Poser, Holden Sakran.&nbsp; USA 2025.&nbsp;9min.&nbsp;</p><p>Reed is troubled by a vision forcing him to do bad things, but nobody believes him. Maybe this new therapist will understand?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dread (European Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Leonardo Benericetti.&nbsp; With: Lasse Meilvang.&nbsp;NORWAY 2025.&nbsp;3min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We meet a patient, trapped in a hospital room, waiting for his judgement after a car accident.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Udders! (World Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Michael Spencer.&nbsp; With: Nicky Maindiratta.&nbsp; USA 2026.&nbsp;6min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What is this naked man running from?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Skinned (London Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Alexandra Ruggieri.&nbsp; With: Wendy Maitlen, Cyrus Stowe.&nbsp; USA 2026.&nbsp;6min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When Lucy’s partner removes the condom mid-sex without consent, she tries to play it cool—until his betrayal drives her to a twisted form of revenge.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Man Eating Pussy (UK Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Emily Lawson.&nbsp; With: Grace Glowicki, Julian Richings, Ted Charette.&nbsp; CANADA 2025.&nbsp;13min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A dying man seeks the ultimate release: a birth in reverse.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>No.3 (UK Premiere)</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Director: Joe Heath.&nbsp; With: Michael X Sommers.&nbsp; USA 2025.&nbsp;13min.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A young man’s desperate plea to use a gas station bathroom leads to the most unforgettable piss of his life.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784763104126temp-1784763104115-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"rating\":\"18\",\"runtime\":\"99\"},\"credits\":{},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.610Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-06T08:44:40.052Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:46:34.754Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a9f4ac0bac8eff48ea\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"GORE FROM OUTER SPACE\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a4d7692d104ae98644c1bbc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 4\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":40,\"color\":\"#c8cdd0\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"6b3f0bd6-f219-b12b-c112-ce0741445a23\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f677\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f678\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a649530cdfcbae85ee3f679\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"l