",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"THE ABOMINABLE SNOWMAN\",\"sort_key\":\"ABOMINABLE SNOWMAN, THE\",\"description\":\"<p>Based on Nigel (Quatermass) Kneale’s television play ‘The Creature’, this subtle Hammer Horror classic from the iconic British studio’s Golden Age follows two men with opposing views going on a Yeti expedition in the Himalayas. Gunrunner Forrest Tucker plans to capture and exploit the legendary creature, while botanist Peter Cushing thinks research is more important. But the highly evolved man-beast surprises both in this gripping slice of monster macabre, tensely directed by Hammer journeyman Val Guest. Eerie claustrophobia conveys a taut paranoid atmosphere in this restored version of the original UK cut complete with original title sequence.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579733634temp-1784579733411-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"1957\",\"runtime\":\"83\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"4K WORLD PREMIERE RESTORATION\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Val Guest\",\"cast\":\"Peter Cushing, Forrest Tucker, Maureen Connell, Richard Wattis\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.641Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:37:27.510Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T12:04:30.533Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71246d929fd78f8b237\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"FULL MOON RISING: THE CHARLES BAND STORY \",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d8f172ba3569f93d018c\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 1\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":166,\"color\":\"#99c6ef\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"18b3da24-c60c-ecd9-f718-b6803037dd63\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d49458\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d49459\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d4945a\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d4945b\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-31T14:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-31T16:50:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":166,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea71246d929fd78f8b23a\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":119,\"quantity_sold\":60,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":59,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"4\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fbc2656dbd237c2b2909f\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":39,\"quantity_sold\":37,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":2,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c3f365982c54a60687e\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e05a\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"FULL MOON RISING: THE CHARLES BAND STORY\",\"sort_key\":\"FULL MOON RISING: THE CHARLES BAND STORY\",\"description\":\"<p>A brand new feature documentary about the truly incredible life and career of Charles Band, prolific producer/director of such genre classics as RE-ANIMATOR, FROM BEYOND, TRANCERS, CASTLE FREAK, the PUPPETMASTER and EVIL BONG franchises and much, much more. Take a deep dive into his early career (discovering John Carpenter who edited the sex comedy LAST FOXTROT IN BURBANK), the Empire Pictures debacle and his Full Moon features success story, along with the Media and Wizard labels that were instrumental in ushering in the home video boom of the 1980s, told in his own words and those closest to him.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577632977temp-1784577632921-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"97\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"World\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Sarah Appleton\",\"cast\":\" Charles Band, Richard Band, Dennis Paoli, John Carpenter\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e05c\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.526Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:43:38.451Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:48:37.063Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: