,\"description\":\"<p>A warm homage to classic  British cinema, Jim Baitte is a layabout sound designer desperate to prove himself working on a new horror flick from the tyrannical B-movie director P.W. Griffin. Accused of lacking vision and creative courage, Jim is sent to the remote island where the film was shot to capture a sound powerful enough to elevate the film's finale. Once there, eerie local fables surface regarding a soul-sucking ghostly sea captain and his spectral crew. As Jim entangles himself further into the bizarre  prophecy, recording the legend might just cost him more than his career.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579981952temp-1784579981914-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"82\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Noah Stratton-Twine, Jake Kuhn\",\"cast\":\"Jack Redmayne, Alyth Ross, Os Leanse, Jason Hogan\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.675Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:35:56.010Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T12:16:29.037Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a7f4ac0bac8eff48d2\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"FRESH MEAT\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\"